  // skyline and nowhere near the pinned sun at 30° elevation. There was no sun in this sky at all.
  //
  // Angle from the sun's centre, in radians, so every constant reads in degrees. acos costs a
  // transcendental on sky pixels only: the dome is drawn after the opaques at renderOrder 10 and early-z
  // rejects it behind terrain, so this runs on the sky, not the frame.
